<title>POLAND: Warsaw bourse clears Impexmetal, Ferrum for trade.</title>
<headline>Warsaw bourse clears Impexmetal, Ferrum for trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of the Warsaw Stock Exchange cleared the shares of metals trader Impexmetal SA and metal pipe maker Huta Ferrum SA for trade on the main market, the bourse said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bourse also approved confectioner Mieszko shares for trade on the parallel market and Elpo to move to the parallel from the free market.</p>
<p>The bourse also said it had approved new shares of Jelfa, Agros, GPRD, Polisa and Warta for bourse trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
